OL,5,G2145 The Essay: Coltrane's Sound
OL,6,     FComposer and minimalism pioneer
OL,7,     FSteve Reich remembers the music of
OL,8,     Fjazz musician John Coltrane.
OL,9,     FPresented by Ashley Kahn.
OL,10,G2200 Night Tracks
OL,11,     FSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,12,     Fadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,13,     Ffor late-night listening, from
OL,14,     Fclassical to contemporary and
OL,15,     Feverything in between.
OL,16,G2330 'Round Midnight
OL,17,     FThis week Soweto marks the
OL,18,     Fcentenary of one the most
OL,19,     Finfluential figures in jazz, John
OL,20,     FColtrane. He is joined by guests
OL,21,     Falong the way, starting with
OL,22,     Fsaxophonist Isaiah Collier.
